{"id":"vod_sn_35581","vodId":"35581","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"食梦者第二季","name_cn":"食梦者第二季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/be042e0eda195e5ed0cd02c74298d0ea.jpg"},"summary":"《食梦者》是大场鸫和小畑健继《死亡笔记》之后再度合作的作品。主人公真诚是一名初三的学生，和大多数人一样对未来并没有什么打算，只想顺其自然的生活，他有着绘画的才能同时暗恋着同班的亚豆。就在一天下课后，他发现自己画有亚豆肖像的笔记本忘在学校了，为了防止被别人发现这个秘密，他急速的跑回了学校。而他的笔记本已经被一个人拿在了手里，那个人是高木。高木对想要拿回笔记本的真诚提出了一个条件：我来写剧本，你来绘画，让我们一起成为漫画家吧。为梦想，两人踏上成为漫画家的道路。本作为2011年秋番档期播放的第二季。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZVyYK3tbs61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fzUncYCfQq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4TkCFej0dJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LuNZYALmE41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MBycCuZ8aw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TqtJmCeug81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V3SJwe7ChY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cmXptNRXid1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K58SvMZnfP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/D9JTKCRsfa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Vt0xiii3Nc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CxswuB3mv91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UYSsRjAL9Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fnh9HbygtB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309